  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "不好意思，\n請問這間咖啡店已經結束營業了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D597D610F601DFF0C000A8ACB554F90199593549655615E975DF27D937D50675F71DF696D4E8655CEFF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看樣子是呢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6A235B50662F54620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說發生了不少事情",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA767C751F4E864E0D5C114E8B60C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣啊……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n睽違10年重訪這座城市，\n我就想喝喝這裡的咖啡呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A23554A2026202600100001BE01000A777D9055003100305E7491CD8A2A90195EA757CE5E02FF0C000A62115C3160F3559D559D901988E17684549655615462300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請問……<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳認不認識\n這裡的相關人員呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB554F2026202600100003110000FF01014F6059B38A8D4E0D8A8D8B58000A901988E1768476F895DC4EBA54E15462FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我認識",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118A8D8B580000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我幫你問問看吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E6B4F60554F554F770B54270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳務必幫忙！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B352D95FC55E6B5FD9FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要找誰問一問呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981627E8AB0554F4E00554F5462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古歷",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E46B770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古麗茲",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E49E9783320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有什麼事嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094EC09EBC4E8B55CEFF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來如此。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這樣的話，請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去問\n新咖啡3號店的店長吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8659826B64300200100001BE01000A90196A2376848A71FF0C8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B353BB554F000A65B0549655610033865F5E9776845E9795775427300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為她曾在\n老闆身邊工作過。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA597966FE5728000A800195C68EAB908A5DE54F5C904E300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叫外送？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EB59169001FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "搞什麼。\n是要找人啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "641E4EC09EBC3002000A662F8981627E4EBA554A300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "弗拉達利咖啡店的老闆？\n那要問3號店的店長啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F1762C990545229549655615E977684800195C6FF1F000A90A38981554F0033865F5E9776845E9795775566300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為她以前應該是\n在老闆手下工作的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA59794EE5524D61C98A72662F000A5728800195C6624B4E0B5DE54F5C7684300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以只要去新咖啡3號店，\n就能知道老闆的狀況了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE553EA898153BB65B0549655610033865F5E97FF0C000A5C3180FD77E59053800195C6768472C06CC14E86FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3號店好像是……\n在<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>蓉粉區<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0033865F5E97597D50CF662F20262026000A572800100002FF00000684C97C89534000100002FF0000005C0D5427300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼我們就在\n新咖啡3號店會合吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC621150115C315728000A65B0549655610033865F5E97670354085427FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳終於來了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B37D4265BC4F864E86FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼我們就去打聽一下\n弗拉達利咖啡店老闆的消息吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC621150115C3153BB6253807D4E004E0B000A5F1762C990545229549655615E97800195C676846D88606F5427300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請問您要……看來不是要點餐呢。\n有什麼我可以效勞的嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB554F60A8898120262026770B4F864E0D662F89819EDE991054623002000A67094EC09EBC621153EF4EE5654852DE768455CEFF1F00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來如此，\n我明白是怎麼一回事了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n弗拉達利咖啡店的老闆\n是教我煮咖啡的師傅。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8659826B64FF0C000A6211660E767D662F600E9EBC4E0056DE4E8B4E86300200100001BE01000A5F1762C990545229549655615E977684800195C6000A662F65596211716E5496556176845E2B5085300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果把客人您的事情告訴老闆，\n我想他也會很開心的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C628A5BA24EBA60A876844E8B60C5544A8A34800195C6FF0C000A621160F34ED64E5F67035F88958B5FC37684300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會去跟老闆聯絡的，\n請在弗拉達利咖啡店的前面稍候。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670353BB8DDF800195C6806F7D617684FF0C000A8ACB57285F1762C990545229549655615E977684524D97627A0D5019300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就到弗拉達利咖啡店的前面\n等待各位！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3152305F1762C990545229549655615E977684524D9762000A7B495F8554044F4DFF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會跟老闆聯絡的，\n請在弗拉達利咖啡店稍候。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038DDF800195C6806F7D617684FF0C000A8ACB57285F1762C990545229549655615E977A0D5019300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "居然能見到老闆……\n總覺得心跳加速了起來。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C45713680FD898B5230800195C620262026000A7E3D89BA5F975FC38DF352A0901F4E868D774F86300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "久等了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E457B494E86300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位就是老闆，\n梅導爾師傅。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D5C31662F800195C6FF0C000A68855C0E723E5E2B5085300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是前老闆喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n都過10年了，\n您還想喝我的咖啡，真是榮幸。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F524D800195C65594300200100001BE01000A90FD904E003100305E744E86FF0C000A60A8908460F3559D6211768454965561FF0C771F662F69AE5E78300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只是有一個問題……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我以前是用寶可夢的招式\n來烘焙咖啡的，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但怎麼說都有好一段時間沒碰了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA662F67094E00500B554F984C2026202600100001BE01000A62114EE5524D662F75285BF653EF5922768462DB5F0F000A4F8670D87119549655617684FF0C00100001BE00000A4F46600E9EBC8AAA90FD6709597D4E006BB5664295936C9278B04E86300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此我有個請求。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請和我進行寶可夢對戰。\n這樣做可以讓我找回感覺。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B6462116709500B8ACB6C42300200100001BE01000A8ACB548C62119032884C5BF653EF59225C0D62303002000A90196A23505A53EF4EE58B936211627E56DE611F89BA300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也和你並肩作戰！老闆。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F548C4F604E2680A94F5C6230FF01800195C6300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿&",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒想到能和拯救了城市的英雄對戰……\n我的感覺也回來了喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9260F3523080FD548C62EF65514E8657CE5E02768482F196C45C0D623020262026000A62117684611F89BA4E5F56DE4F864E865594300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼請移步到咖啡店吧。\n我這就來準備咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC8ACB79FB6B655230549655615E9754273002000A621190195C314F866E96509954965561300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然有一點髒，但狀態很好。\n只要好好洗乾淨，應該就沒問題了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713667094E009EDE9AD2FF0C4F4672C0614B5F88597D3002000A53EA8981597D597D6D174E7E6DE8FF0C61C98A725C316C92554F984C4E86300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊……我能夠端出\n那個時候的咖啡了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554A20262026621180FD59207AEF51FA000A90A3500B664250197684549655614E86300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我這就去準備，\n請入座稍候一下。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190195C3153BB6E965099FF0C000A8ACB51655EA77A0D50194E004E0B300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊……\n就是那時候的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554A20262026000A5C31662F90A366425019768454965561300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這直竄鼻腔的香氣……\n請容我用全身細細品味。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901976F47AC49F3B8154768499996C2320262026000A8ACB5BB96211752851688EAB7D307D3054C15473300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老闆！這咖啡和10年前一樣……\n不，比那時更上一層樓。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800195C6FF01901954965561548C003100305E74524D4E006A2320262026000A4E0DFF0C6BD490A3664266F44E0A4E005C646A13300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您給了我最高的讚譽呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A87D664E86621167009AD876848B9A8B7D5462300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，有件事\n我得向客人您道歉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C67094EF64E8B000A62115F9754115BA24EBA60A890536B49300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是什麼意思呢？\n咖啡這麼美味，卻要道歉？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F4EC09EBC610F601D5462FF1F000A5496556190199EBC7F8E5473FF0C537B898190536B49FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其實那杯咖啡\n是我為客人您泡的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765BE690A3676F54965561000A662F621170BA5BA24EBA60A86CE17684300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF01FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我本來是個受雇的老闆，\n但因為閃焰隊的那件事而引退了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211672C4F86662F500B53D796C77684800195C6FF0C000A4F4656E070BA95837130968A768490A34EF64E8B800C5F1590004E86300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過店長說無論如何都想留下那份滋味。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E5E9795778AAA71218AD659824F5590FD60F375594E0B90A34EFD6ECB5473300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "城市雖然會不斷變化下去，\n但也有些事物不該改變。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n老闆的咖啡就是其中之一。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57CE5E0296D6713667034E0D65B78B8A53164E0B53BBFF0C000A4F464E5F67094E9B4E8B72694E0D8A7265398B8A300200100001BE00000A800195C67684549655615C31662F51764E2D4E4B4E00300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在密阿雷生活過的人和寶可夢\n即使不在了，我也希望能以某種形式<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n將各自的生活樣貌保留下來呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285BC6963F96F7751F6D3B904E76844EBA548C5BF653EF5922000A53734F7F4E0D57284E86FF0C62114E5F5E0C671B80FD4EE567D07A2E5F625F0F00100001BE00000A5C07540481EA7684751F6D3B6A238C8C4FDD75594E0B4F865462300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊……我很感激今後\n還能喝到我最喜歡的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554A2026202662115F88611F6FC04ECA5F8C000A908480FD559D523062116700559C6B61768454965561300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "儘管不知道會是什麼時侯，\n但我再來密阿雷時，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我會來喝店長的咖啡的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51187BA14E0D77E590536703662F4EC09EBC66424FAFFF0C000A4F466211518D4F865BC6963F96F76642FF0C00100001BE00000A621167034F86559D5E9795777684549655617684300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恭候您的光臨。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "606D501960A87684514981E8300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    }
